    "order": 89,
    "anchor": "tactical-missions-2",
    "summary": "A team using Tactical Missions shuffles its Secondary Mission deck and keeps it face-down, then:\n\n- as its [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, draws 2 cards face-up; these are its active Secondary Missions\n- once per battle, as its [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) ends, may spend 1 CP to discard 1 active Secondary Mission card and draw 1 new one",
